  "notes": "Gatefold sleeve.\nIncludes glossy artwork inner sleeves with photos, lyrics, and credits.\n\nSides identified by letters on tracklist except for side C, titled \"Side 3\" instead.\nCatalog # indicated as 63881-27148-1AB on first inner sleeve.\nCatalog # indicated as 63881-27148-1CD on second inner sleeve.\nRunouts are etched.\nTrack durations are not indicated on the release.\n\nSome copies are mispressed, causing them to jump around 3/4 of the way through 'Ball and Biscuit' in the guitar solo.\n\nAll songs on this album recorded to eight track reel-to-reel at Toe-Rag Studios, Hackney, London in April 2002, except track B1 recorded at the BBC Maida Vale Studios.  No computers were used during the writing, recording, mixing or mastering of this record.\n\nAll songs written by Jack White, Peppermint Stripe Music (BMI), except [B1] written by B. Bacharach and H. David [New Hidden Valley Music Co. c/o WB Music Corp. / Casa David (ASCAP)].\n\n℗ 2003 Third Man Records, Inc. under exclusive license to V2 Records Inc.\n© 2003 Third Man Records, Inc. under exclusive license to V2 Records Inc.\nV2 Records, 14 East 4th Street, New York, NY 10012\nManufactured and distributed in the United States by BMG Distribution, a unit of BMG Entertainment.\n1540 Broadway, New York, NY 10036.  \nBMG is a trademark of BMG Music.\nMade in the U.S.A.",
  "released_formatted": "01 Apr 2003",
